<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Barrett Resources EPS cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Barrett Resources EPS cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hanifen, Imhoff Inc said it cut its earnings estimates for Barrett Resources Corp for 1997 to $1.40 a share from $1.55 and for 1998 to $1.59 a share from $1.69. Its first quarter earnings estimate remains $0.34 a share.</p>
<p>-- Hanifen said it cut the 1997 and 1998 estimates due to some well-drilling and production delays.</p>
<p>-- Hanifen has a buy rating on Barrett Resources, which closed Tuesday up one at 30-7/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
